",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d5\"},\"ref\":\"d5\",\"snippet\":\" ... In February, Gregory Andrews died suddenly while on a business trip in South Africa. The 47-year-old Andrews had served only eight months as the company's CEO. Stunned, Carson's board appointed Malcolm Yesner as acting CEO. Yesner, who had served previously as president of the ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.encyclopedia.com/books/politics-and-business-magazines/carson-inc\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d6\"},\"ref\":\"d6\",\"snippet\":\" ... Russell & Company\\n\\nAge: 59 | Location: Atlanta, GA\\n\\nRussell is the CEO of H.J. Russell & Company, a Black-owned real estate developer in Atlanta that was founded by his father in 1952. The company has developed significant projects, including the construction of the NFL's Atlanta Falcons Mercedes ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.forbes.com/sites/jabariyoung/2024/12/19/forbes-blk-50-2024/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d7\"},\"ref\":\"d7\",\"snippet\":\" ... The synagogue closed in the 1990s.The smaller congregations progressivejews.co.za. Retrieved on 21 July 2024 \\n\\nThe Nobel Prize-winning Jewish writer, Nadine Gordimer was raised in Springs. Her father was a member of a local synagogue and attended Yom Kippur services.Gordimer, Nadine.A South African ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Springs,_South_Africa\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d8\"},\"ref\":\"d8\",\"snippet\":\" ... She co-founded the Mid-Atlantic Plein Air Painters Association (MAPAPA) and the Paint Annapolis plein air competition to launch Paint the Town, the first plein air event in Chesapeake City, Maryland. Her work is featured in the book \\\"100 Plein Air Painters of the Mid-Atlantic\\\" by ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.westmont.edu/80-notable-alumni\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"dd5dec9da767c6fbaae32977c039864fa2319c913f2030f6ac762a52850fe0f2\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"10dd9bc3a263aea6a1c657918ed62476efc12a9013e136ed99ec8d61bde9a9d9\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"CEO founded company mid-1990s raised Southern Africa father engineer\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d9\"},\"ref\":\"d9\",\"snippet\":\" ... Tosca Musk\\n\\nTosca Musk, Elon Musk's younger sister, runs a streaming service called Passionflix. She's been producing movies since 2001, and has made more than 50 to date, according to her IMDb page.\\n\\nShe is the cofounder and CEO of Passionflix, a streaming service for movies ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.businessinsider.com/elon-musk-family-tree\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d10\"},\"ref\":\"d10\",\"snippet\":\" ... Eunji from Apink plays Hee-sun, the younger sister of Soo's first love Hee-joo.\\n\\nWhile serving in the military, private An Jun-ho is transferred to the Deserter Pursuit unit, a team of military police officers tasked with capturing deserters. (Upon its release, D.P. received ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.netflix.com/tudum/articles/netflix-k-dramas-k-pop-idols\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d11\"},\"ref\":\"d11\",\"snippet\":\" ... film.\\\"\\n\\nMusk co-founded Passionflix in 2017 with a couple of friends. It is a word play on Netflix, but it is a streaming service that appeals to women who enjoy romance novels and romantic films and television shows.\\n\\n\\\"Romance novels aren't often turned into films,\\\" Whitaker ... \",\"title\":\"https://saportareport.com/filmmaker-tosca-musk-moves-her-base-to-georgia/sections/reports/maria_saporta/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d12\"},\"ref\":\"d12\",\"snippet\":\" ... of the Norwegian team of researchers who first encountered the terrifying enemy that later attacked the American team of scientists.\\n\\nFree Horror Movies Streaming On Vizio\\n\\nVizio has returned with a roster of new horror films on their streaming service for April. Just remember that while the weather ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.fangoria.com/56-free-horror-movies-streaming-in-april-2025/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d13\"},\"ref\":\"d13\",\"snippet\":\" ... Cherrywinkle (originally made three years before, in Canada only, presented by American Public Television)\\n\\n- Dragon Tales (one of the very first shows to premiere on PBS Kids; one of the few shows to be co-produced by a major Hollywood studio- in this case Sony Pictures Television with ... \",\"title\":\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Creator/PBSKids\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d14\"},\"ref\":\"d14\",\"snippet\":\" ... She co-founded Passionflix, a streaming platform that hosts movie adaptions of romance novels. The fan-focused service is home to many movies directed by Musk herself.\\n\\nThe entrepreneur is making waves as a woman in the male-dominated movie industry. However, Tosca's own brother, Kimbal Musk ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.nickiswift.com/870938/the-untold-truth-of-tosca-musk-elons-younger-sister/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d15\"},\"ref\":\"d15\",\"snippet\":\" ... Relocating to Toronto in 1868, Fraser co-founded Notman & Fraser, a celebrated photographic firm, and influenced a generation of artists, including Robert Gagen, Homer Watson, George Reid, and Horatio Walker. Selected for the first CPR pass program in 1886 alongside O'Brien and John Collins Forbes, Fraser exhibited ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.whyte.org/posts\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d16\"},\"ref\":\"d16\",\"snippet\":\" ... the younger sister to her two older brothers, Elon and Kimbal Musk. Like her brothers, she harnesses an entrepreneurial spirit.\\n\\nAdvertisement\\n\\nIn 2017, Musk co-founded Passionflix alongside screenwriter Joany Kane and Hollywood producer Jina Panebianco. Kane initially had the idea of creating a streaming service centred around ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.scmp.com/magazines/style/celebrity/article/3182118/meet-elon-musks-sister-tosca-founder-netflix-style\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"af9e50287fb0d025fee8e90584d2a82792558dc05c5d0a26a3871f09918f9c01\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"cf2ec3a37adeb348223df68414b30e23323e5be10dcf9d5b83ec470dbee19aa1\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"first child SIDS CEO younger sister co-founded film streaming service\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits