aunched in 2020. In addition to being CEO of SpaceX, Musk was ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.britannica.com/money/Elon-Musk\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d24\"},\"ref\":\"d24\",\"snippet\":\" ... The Star named him one of the stars to watch for in 2018 alongside musician Sho Madjozi and other notable South Africans.\\n\\n5. Isaac Mbatha, 28, South Africa\\n\\nFounder and CEO: Sky Tents SA\\n\\nWhen Isaac Mbatha was little, he used to sell sweets to his school mates ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.forbesafrica.com/under-30/2019/07/01/30under30-business-category-2019/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"f9d29b8ae9102eeee2a32faee65744618871f34cb85062354da5a03184084070\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"08047a3a6bf25811375d6f47e6558e28c289a63b234a8cf33710e98e6381a698\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"CEO child unusual name internet buzzing early 2020s Southern Africa\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_731d1540cff1442f88d6c10f"},{"content":"The clues strongly point to Elon Musk: raised in South Africa, younger sister Tosca Musk co-founded Passionflix (a film streaming service), and he had a child with Grimes in the early 2020s with an unusual name (X Æ A-12). Now I need to find the specific article about a lady who claimed to be related to him, and the age at which her mother gave birth to her.\n\nLet me search for this specific story.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": \"woman claimed related Elon Musk mother age gave birth article\\\", \\\"Elon Musk relative claim woman mother young age birth early 2020s\\\", \\\"lady claimed Elon Musk relative mother age when born article\\\"]\", \"top_k\": 8}","name":